{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets user tags for device segmentation."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTags:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSDictionary","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSDictionary"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"tags"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"tags","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dictionary of tag names and values to set for the current device"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tags are key-value pairs that enable targeted push notifications based on user attributes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and behavior. Use tags to segment your audience and send personalized messages to specific","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"user groups.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Supported Tag Types","type":"heading","anchor":"Supported-Tag-Types","level":2},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Type","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Example"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"String","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"city\": \"New York\""}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text values"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Integer"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"age\": 25"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Numeric values","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Boolean","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"isPremium\": true"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"True\/false values","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"List"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"interests\": [\"sports\", \"music\"]"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrays of strings"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Date","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"lastPurchase\": Date()"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"NSDate objects"}]}]]],"type":"table"},{"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Update user profile tags after account changes:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class UserProfileManager {","","    func updateUserTags(for user: User) {","        var tags: [String: Any] = [","            \"user_id\": user.id,","            \"email_verified\": user.isEmailVerified,","            \"account_type\": user.accountType.rawValue,","            \"signup_date\": user.createdAt,","            \"app_version\": Bundle.main.appVersion","        ]","","        \/\/ Add subscription info if premium","        if let subscription = user.subscription {","            tags[\"subscription_tier\"] = subscription.tier.rawValue","            tags[\"subscription_expiry\"] = subscription.expiryDate","            tags[\"is_premium\"] = true","        } else {","            tags[\"is_premium\"] = false","        }","","        \/\/ Add user preferences","        if !user.interests.isEmpty {","            tags[\"interests\"] = user.interests","        }","","        \/\/ Add location if available","        if let location = user.location {","            tags[\"country\"] = location.country","            tags[\"city\"] = location.city","            tags[\"timezone\"] = location.timezone","        }","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags(tags)","        Logger.debug(\"User tags updated: \\(tags.keys.joined(separator: \", \"))\")","    }","","    func trackPurchase(product: Product, amount: Decimal) {","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"last_purchase_date\": Date(),","            \"last_purchase_amount\": NSDecimalNumber(decimal: amount),","            \"last_purchase_category\": product.category,","            \"total_purchases\": incrementTag(\"total_purchases\")","        ])","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setTags:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/settags:"]}],"metadata":{"title":"setTags:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTags:"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setTags:"},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"title":"PWConfiguration","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","title":"PushwooshCore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setTags:":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTags:"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/settags:","title":"setTags:","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setTags:","abstract":[{"text":"Sets user tags for device segmentation.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"}}}